<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1823217297"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:05.843"><div begin="17.309" end="44.629" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="17.309" end="20.152" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.309" end="17.740">若不</span><span begin="17.740" end="18.082">是</span><span begin="18.082" end="18.575">由</span><span begin="18.575" end="18.922">你</span><span begin="18.922" end="19.450">经</span><span begin="19.450" end="20.152">过</span></p><p begin="21.149" end="24.198" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.149" end="21.476">我怎</span><span begin="21.476" end="21.802">知</span><span begin="21.802" end="22.265">感</span><span begin="22.265" end="22.684">情</span><span begin="22.684" end="23.341">形</span><span begin="23.341" end="24.198">容</span></p><p begin="24.901" end="29.609" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.901" end="25.259">夜越</span><span begin="25.259" end="25.616">黑</span><span begin="25.616" end="26.040">越</span><span begin="26.040" end="26.470">有</span><span begin="26.470" end="26.818">繁</span><span begin="26.818" end="27.428">星</span><span begin="28.266" end="28.681">闪</span><span begin="28.681" end="29.609">烁</span></p><p begin="32.450" end="35.124" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.450" end="33.119">若不是</span><span begin="33.119" end="33.613">由</span><span begin="33.613" end="33.841">你</span><span begin="33.841" end="34.335">诉</span><span begin="34.335" end="35.124">说</span></p><p begin="36.121" end="39.079" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.121" end="36.523">我如</span><span begin="36.523" end="36.806">何</span><span begin="36.806" end="37.586">挣脱</span><span begin="37.586" end="38.299">枷</span><span begin="38.299" end="39.079">锁</span></p><p begin="39.884" end="44.629" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.884" end="40.601">去感知</span><span begin="40.601" end="41.385">那些</span><span begin="41.385" end="42.005">自</span><span begin="42.005" end="42.560">我</span><span begin="43.084" end